A||||12||BV MotorSports||woohoo! F-body kill||||10||
Z||000000||BV MotorSports||06-20-2001||04:45 PM||||Hey all. Lemme start out with the situation that lead up too the kill.<P>Was at work and was talking to some young rent-a-cop kid. He was saying how nice the Fiero v6 sounded then he messed up (just when he was getting on my good side!) and said "too bad those things are fire traps 'cause they really look cool"!<BR>So I kinda told him he was a morron and that my car has just under 100k miles on it, is 14 years old and isnt a big melted piece of plastic in a j-yard.  Said a few other "choice words" and then the clown said "you better hope you dont pull up to my 91 Z28 anytime...I'll hand you your a$$".<P>What ever... SO I get off at 6:30am and start heading home. Look down and watch the odometer hit 100k miles. I cheer for my hooptie and give her a little pat on the dash and say "good girl, heres to another 100k"! I hit the red light at the end of the company property and cut a right and open her up.<P>Go a few miles up the road and get ready to take my favorite turn. Guess who is behind me? Yep rent-a-cop boy! So I feed a little throttle and see if he is game. Yep on my ass, I down shift into 2nd and open her up.... (this is an on ramp for hwy 105. starts east and ends up north, nice sweeping right turn with a nasty decreasing radius at the end posted 25mph).....rent-a-cop is about 2 car lenghts behind me and starts to lift, I stay into it and start trail-braking, clip the apex and get on her hard. <BR>Hit 3rd and look into my rear view and there comes rent-a-cop looking so outta shape and no less than 10 car lenghts behind. <BR>I cant stop laughing!<BR>I slow and wait for him to catch up, he does but then wont even look over at me! Heheheheh<BR>I cant wait to go to work Friday night and rub it in.<P>Heres to the Fiero! May yours give you many many years of faithfull service. I know its been the best car I have ever owned.<P>Steven<P>------------------<BR>87 Fiero GT 14.9/ 93mph<BR>94 Formula WS6 w/ NOS 12.4 /118mph<BR>87 Conquest TSi <BR>85.5 Starion ESi||||reg||10
Z||000001||Galen||06-20-2001||04:54 PM||||Power to immortal fiero soul. Shall it forever lay the smack down upon all fbodies.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/devil.gif">       <BR>   <A HREF="mailto:galen@spinrpg.com">galen@spinrpg.com</A>    -<A HREF="http://myfiero.spinrpg.com/" TARGET=_blank>1988 Hawaiin Orchid Coupe w/ sunroof</A><BR>AIM: GalenRPG - <A HREF="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/" TARGET=_blank>WebJolt Pictures</A>||||reg||1
