Z||000004||Bazooka||06-20-2001||07:04 PM||||Gee Whiz, Did you ever ask what 'Rent a Cop kid' was running under his hood, when you Blew his Doors Off by 10 Lengths??? 350, 305, or 6 cylinder, and whats your engine/power adders???  Can't help asking. <A HREF="http://hometown.aol.com/m34chev/myhomepage/auto.html" TARGET=_blank>http://hometown.aol.com/m34chev/myhomepage/auto.html</A> <BR>********************************************<BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BV MotorSports:<BR><B>Hey all. Lemme start out with the situation that lead up too the kill.<P>Was at work and was talking to some young rent-a-cop kid. He was saying how nice the Fiero v6 sounded then he messed up (just when he was getting on my good side!) and said "too bad those things are fire traps 'cause they really look cool"!<BR>So I kinda told him he was a morron and that my car has just under 100k miles on it, is 14 years old and isnt a big melted piece of plastic in a j-yard.  Said a few other "choice words" and then the clown said "you better hope you dont pull up to my 91 Z28 anytime...I'll hand you your a$$".<BR>What ever... Steven<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>||||reg||1
Z||000005||firstfiero||06-20-2001||07:15 PM||||     It doesn't matter what engine he has...I don't car what he has under the hood that stock fbody is not going to corner like his fiero. If you read the post again you'll thats where he left him in the dust!<BR>     Great kill....heres to another 100 grand in the only car gm has made in the last 20 + years worth owning. Todd<P>------------------<BR>Hey Mr. Ricer come over here and tell me how your stickers make you faster.....<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headshot.gif">         <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||14
