Z||000008||BV MotorSports||06-20-2001||10:18 PM||||<BR>Engine mods? Not many..runs high 14's. Mostly suspension work. I never said I smoked the guy in a straight line. I new he didnt have a chance in the curves. Remember I own a 94 Formula WS6 so I know the Fiero can out handle it so a 3rd gen wouldnt have a chance. Now staight line? Different story.....<P>BTW I won the 1 on 1 races at Langley Speedway tonight. Added an extra qt of oil and she didnt cut out on me in turns 3-4.<BR>Now I just have to remeber to drain out that extra oil in the morning. <P>Competitors:<BR>85 Mustang GT<BR>99 Dodge Dakota (2nd place)<BR>00 Civic Si w/ JAckson racing supercharger<BR>99 Type R Integra<BR>85 Camaro<BR>87 Escort GT<BR>89 Shadow<BR>90 Spirit RT<BR>78 Chevy truck<BR>98 Prelude<BR>Shelby Daytona<BR>Newer Golf VR6<BR>and some others.<P>Fiero walks away from them all! Beat the Type R by almost 1/4 of the track! Cant race again till September for the night of champions.<P>Gotta love that Fiero!<P>Steven<P><P>------------------<BR>87 Fiero GT 14.9/ 93mph<BR>94 Formula WS6 w/ NOS 12.4 /118mph<BR>87 Conquest TSi <BR>85.5 Starion ESi||||reg||14
Z||000009||SilverFieroV6||06-20-2001||10:34 PM||||so what have you done as of mods.  My 85 silverfiero with and auto has the fastest time as 16.373 in the 1/4 mile.  The car is completely stock.  Right now i have take the gold one i got a few weeks ago to the track yet,  i am trying to go next week as the o2 sensor will be replaced either tonight or tommorow morning.<BR>Thanks<BR>Sam<P>is that the langley spedway thats right across from the nasa building??   i had my first motorcycle reace there about 6yrs ago.<p>[This message has been edited by SilverFieroV6 (edited 06-20-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000010||BV MotorSports||06-20-2001||10:51 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by SilverFieroV6:<BR><B>so what have you done as of mods.  My 85 silverfiero with and auto has the fastest time as 16.373 in the 1/4 mile.  The car is completely stock.<BR>Thanks<BR>Sam</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Sam, not a whole lot of "real mods" the best one was the addition of 1.6 roller tipped rocker arms. They really wake up the 2.8.<BR>Engine has never been rebuilt and has 100k on her.<BR>Mods include:<BR>underdrive pulley<BR>ram-air fed w/ k&n<BR>Accel coil, 8.8 wires, ign module and plugs<BR>MSD 6AL w/ 6k RPM limit "chip"<BR>Ported manifolds<BR>F-body Flowmaster muf'<BR>Hypertech chip (useless! get the one from Joe @ Associated auto) p-stat and cool fan switch.<BR>Centerforce clutch<P>I dunno why everone thinks these cars are so slow. My car ran a 15.6 BONE STOCK (well I did remove the air filter)when I first bought it. And yep, I have it on video b4 and after.<P>Steven<P><P>------------------<BR>87 Fiero GT 14.9/ 93mph<BR>94 Formula WS6 w/ NOS 12.4 /118mph<BR>87 Conquest TSi <BR>85.5 Starion ESi||||reg||6
